  "details": "-Allowing World Creators to make their world 18+ only such as night clubs, drinking worlds, or any NSFW world creators.\n\n-Allowing users to create their own public instance that is 18+ with age verification, those under the age will not be able to go through portals or join these 18+ public instances. \n\nThis would allow for adults to enjoy time with each other, filters out children lying about how old they are, and allows us to have fun without worrying about having a bunch of children screaming next to you.\n\nI love to go meet new people in public lobbies but at times it’s been insufferable because of children joining and parents letting their 8 year old use a headset they got for Christmas or their birthday. I’m sure a lot of other adults of VRChat would like to see this feature implemented into the game.",
